    - rid: 148572961683013784
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: " \\n\\n\\n\\n\\nI thought it wise to start a new journal while
          I document my research. Whoever finds this  in the future I hope my work
          aids you to any degree, for I now know what it is like to be at the mercy
          of the unknown.\\n\\n  My initial work was centred around biological enhancement.
          A somewhat gray area within the Veils teachings. I chose to balance on
          a thin line where the practicing of the Old Gods almost dared to blur into
          the now.\\n\\n Their \u201Cenhancements\u201D were heretical, undignified
          mutilations of the human body;  "
